rectly on arrival, dwell or rider presence; both disputes_with_counterparty_90d counters are 0; rider_profile.no_show_disputes_30d is 1, below the required 3; and the POL-NS-07 anti-farming check does not trip (below).\n\nOn that evidence the driver was inside the 50 m geofence from 12:30:00 until he cancelled at 12:38:20, more than the 300 seconds required, so limb (c) is satisfied and all four limbs of POL-NS-01 hold. No clause from POL-NS-03 to POL-NS-06 displaces them: POL-NS-03 does not apply because the driver's fixes lie inside the arrival radius and registered_pickup_points is 1; POL-NS-04 does not exonerate the rider because it fails at its own limb (b) - the driver replied at 12:31:20, eighteen seconds after the rider's 12:31:02 message, far inside the 120-second window, and messaged again at 12:35:10.\n\nPOL-NS-07 then fixes the payout at 80 per cent of the SGD 4.00 net cancellation fee in force, that is SGD 3.20, and the fare line reconciles with the figure produced by fee_schedule.resolution_rule (POL-NS-08(d) is not engaged). The anti-farming check does not trip: driver_profile.no_show_terminations_30d is 2, below the required count of 4, and 2 divided by completed_trips_30d of 146 is 0.014, below the required rate of 0.08. Those two profile fields are cited only for the test POL-NS-07 names, as POL-GEN-01 requires; no other profile field is used as a ground of decision. The monetary effect, SGD 3.20, does not exceed the SGD 8.00 execution threshold, so the payment executes automatically on issue under POL-GEN-05, subject to POL-GEN-04. No clause produces a referral on these facts."
  },
